ich will include:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A campaign spanning seven seas, each with its own unique flavor, challenges, and win conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wacky roster of specialized crew members with unique promotion paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct unlockable weapons, seacrafts, and equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses, enemies, quests, hazards and environmental effects</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Sail your way to victory on a deadly campaign across the Seven Seas in a seafaring sandbox survivors-like. Hunt menacing beasts of legend, complete deliveries, win races, defend outposts, find treasures or gamble it all in an oceanic world driven by chaos, risk, and opportunity.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Simplified Chinese, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421870/1922bf43c097b6b1b9c1adc24a134ac03416abb7/header.jpg?t=1787511924", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421870/fd30c53331249597d0141c818e8bad44ab8adeee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787511924", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4421870/fd30c53331249597d0141c818e8bad44ab8adeee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787511924", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia Geforce 1650<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requ